    "description": "With the publication of Hal Higdon's Half Marathon Training, I added a new intermediate schedule. Previously, there was only one, titled \"Intermediate.\" Now there are two: \"Intermediate 1\" and \"Intermediate 2.\" The difference is that Intermediate 1 is an endurance-based program; Intermediate 2 is a speed-based program. These two intermediate schedules exist in a parallel universe, the ... Continue reading \"Intermediate 2\"",
